<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<style>
.legal-container {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 2rem auto 4rem auto;
  padding: 2.5rem;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
}

.legal-header {
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
  padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.legal-header h1 {
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: #222222;
}

.legal-section-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #222222;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.legal-text {
  color: #555555;
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}
</style>

<div class="legal-container">
  <div class="legal-header">
    <h1>Cancellation Options</h1>
    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: "long", day: "numeric", year: "numeric" }) %></p>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-content">
    <p class="legal-text">
      Wanderlust offers clear and flexible cancellation options to give guests and hosts peace of mind when plans change.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">1. Flexible Cancellation Policy</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      Guests can cancel up to 24 hours before check-in for a full refund. Host service fees may vary based on specific listing terms.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">2. Moderate &amp; Strict Options</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      Some hosts set moderate (5-day prior cancellation) or strict policies depending on seasonal demand and booking constraints. Always review your listing details prior to booking.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">3. Extenuating Circumstances</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      In cases of unexpected travel disruptions or emergency events, our support team can assist in processing overrides or re-booking options.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top">
    <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-1"></i> Back to Listings
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
